    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the immortal god\u2019s seven deadly incarnations in a brutal 2D boss rush adventure. Each incarnation tests your skill in high-stakes, fast-paced combat. Be fast and strategic with your fluid movements, as Dashing and Jumping drains your mana, replenished by Parrying.<br><br> Absorb their powers with every victory, upgrading your own abilities and becoming powerful enough to take on the final, god-like tyrant. Time your moves, master your skills, and unleash powerful combos to break the cycle of sin.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the immortal god\u2019s seven deadly incarnations in a brutal 2D boss rush adventure. Each incarnation tests your skill in high-stakes, fast-paced combat. Be fast and strategic with your fluid movements, as Dashing and Jumping drains your mana, replenished by Parrying.<br><br> Absorb their powers with every victory, upgrading your own abilities and becoming powerful enough to take on the final, god-like tyrant. Time your moves, master your skills, and unleash powerful combos to break the cycle of sin.</p>",
    "short_description": "ESCAVE is a fast paced boss rush game that challenges your mastery of movement and timing. Every jump and dash drains mana, which is replenished by parrying. Face divine incarnations, claim their powers, and face the GOD himself in the final battle.",
